{
  "id": "disclaimer",
  "kind": "introduction",
  "sourceKind": "disclaimer",
  "label": "Disclaimer",
  "title": "DISCLAIMER",
  "shortTitle": "DISCLAIMER",
  "sourceRange": [
    45,
    63
  ],
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "title": 45
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book is a work of philosophical reflection, personal observation, and exploratory thought."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 46
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The ideas presented within these pages are not intended to be absolute truths, scientific conclusions, psychological diagnoses, professional advice, or universal explanations of reality."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 47
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "They are observations."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Questions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 49
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Perspectives."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 50
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Experiments in looking."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 51
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The purpose of this book is not to tell the reader what to believe, but to invite deeper examination of experience itself."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 52
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Different readers may interpret these ideas differently."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 53
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That is not a weakness of the work"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 54
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is part of its subject."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 55
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Reality, meaning, identity, perception, and understanding have been explored by philosophers, psychologists, scientists, and thinkers for centuries. This book does not claim to settle those discussions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 56
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It simply participates in them."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 57
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Readers are encouraged to think independently, question freely, and form their own conclusions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 58
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Or perhaps, at times, to remain without conclusions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 59
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If any value exists within these pages, it is not in providing certainty."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is in encouraging observation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 61
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Nothing more."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 62
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Nothing less."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 63
    }
  ],
  "suppressHeaderNumber": true,
  "index": 3,
  "file": "chapters/03-disclaimer.json"
}
